abstract: "Compact PyTorch neuro-symbolic neural architecture grounded in the deterministic 8-bit binary combinatorics of the Beninese Fa system (16 Kpoli keys on the 4-bit binary hypercube, 256 Du states via Kronecker attention, continuous FaReLU/FaSigma residual layers, and O(16) ontological balance regularization). Validated across 8 reproducible Kaggle Tesla T4 benchmarks (5-Fold x 5 seeds) and selected as a representative case in the FOCAC / China-BRICS 2026 AI Case Innovation Competition for African Youth."
